sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as You
  participant P as Viewer page (IGV.js)
  participant S as Allelescope server
  participant D as Files on the server
  U->>P: Click a variant row or add a position
  opt First visit, more than 2,000 read pairs
    P->>S: How many read pairs cross chrom:pos?
    P->>U: Subsample (2,000 suggested) or use all reads?
  end
  P->>S: Ask for reads at chrom:pos with the current filter settings
  alt First visit to this site
    S->>D: Read alignment.markdup.bam
    Note over S,D: Count alleles over all reads<br/>Keep all reads, or the subsample<br/>Fetch mates and split partners, tag every read
    S->>D: Save per-site BAM in instance/bam/
  end
  Note over S,D: Apply the filters to the per-site BAM
  S->>D: Save filtered BAM in data-dir/cache/instance/
  S-->>P: Filtered BAM + index
  P-->>U: "Spanning Reads Only" track is redrawn
